 HISTORY                                                          8349 1451
 -------                                                          8349 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8349 1451
 (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. The        8349 1451
 inelastic scattering thermal scattering law data for uranium     8349 1451
 mononitride (UN) was developed using ab initio lattice dynamics  8349 1451
 methods [1-2]. The Full Law Analysis Scattering System Hub       8349 1451
 (FLASSH) code was used to produce MF=7 and MT=2 and 4 for U in   8349 1451
 UN (U 93% enrichment - HEU) [3]. MAT=8349 and ZA=8449 are used   8349 1451
 for U in UN (U 93% enrichment - HEU).                            8349 1451
